      ],
      "en": "Foolish Galatians, who has bewitched you not to obey the truth, before whose eyes Jesus Christ was openly portrayed among you as crucified?",
      "ko": "어리석도다 갈라디아 사람들아 예수 그리스도께서 십자가에 못 박히신 것이 너희 눈앞에 밝히 보이거늘 누가 너희를 꾀더냐",
      "source_text_hash": "6ae740e276d0b08f89cd8c8faeefc40b8d564aa84df58981f959ede6c506363c",
      "translation_text_hash": "24e114badfe4b58119768cf725092dcae611036449f5b70b433ded0f7040d5e0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "어리석도다 갈라디아 사람들아 예수 그리스도께서 십자가에 못 박히신 것이 너희 눈앞에 밝히 보이거늘 누가 너희를 꾀더냐"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "24e114badfe4b58119768cf725092dcae611036449f5b70b433ded0f7040d5e0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:GAL:3:2",
      "sequence": 29101,
      "chapter_label": "GAL 3",
      "verse_label": "2",
      "locator": {
        "book": "GAL",
